{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10210","headline":"秋晓招隐寺东峰茶宴送内弟阎伯均归江州 · 李嘉佑","name":"秋晓招隐寺东峰茶宴送内弟阎伯均归江州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万畦新稻傍山村，数里深松到寺门。\n幸有香茶留穉子，不堪秋草送王孙。\n烟尘怨别唯愁隔，井邑萧条谁忍论。\n莫怪临歧独垂泪，魏舒偏念外家恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}